name: Erratic Hearts Spike — many Hearts
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 20 Hearts, a suit spike for Flush lines,
  Lusty Joker, Bloodstone, and Oops casino builds. RAG aliases: erratic hearts,
  all Hearts, heart flush seed, Bloodstone casino, red suit pile.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticSuit: Hearts
    min: 20
should:
  - joker: Bloodstone
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 60
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    label: "Doubles Bloodstone's listed probability"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: LustyJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    label: "Combines Hearts and Diamonds into red-suit support"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
